&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2421&quot; title=&quot;AngularObject miss AngularObjectListener when it is pushed from frontend&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2421&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2421&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. AngularObject miss AngularObjectListener when it is pushed from frontend&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
